      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What moves?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006100740020006D006F007600650073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See, if you press <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0008><U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0004>Plus<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> before selecting a move for\nyour Pokémon, you’ll be able to use moves they’ve<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmastered as Plus Moves!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s a special way to increase the power of moves\nby using Mega Power!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 15,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 218
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Though if you want to unlock more Plus Moves,\nyou’ll need <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Seeds of Mastery<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
